    "url": "https://www.dlib.si/details/URN:NBN:SI:DOC-TMG3QFI9",
    "notes": "Role: primary. Primary scientific reference for this repository. University of Ljubljana catalogue: COBISS 77808131; national-library URN:NBN:SI:DOC-TMG3QFI9. Defended 21 September 2021. Marko Topič is the advisor, not a coauthor. No thesis DOI has been verified. Citation does not claim that every thesis chapter is implemented. CCYA implementation follows sections 7.5.1–7.5.3 (pp. 150–164), with equations 3.6/3.8 for thermal context. The institutional full text is https://repozitorij.uni-lj.si/Dokument.php?id=148326&lang=eng. Explicit choices for monthly centroid scaling, incremental temperature normalization, nonexceedance quantiles and cumulative ratio versus signed gain are documented in docs/ccya.md; no numerical reproduction of Bolzano is claimed.",
    "year": 2021,
    "institution": {
      "name": "University of Ljubljana, Faculty of Electrical Engineering"
    },
    "thesis-type": "Doctoral dissertation"
  },
